1
00:00:08,840 --> 00:00:10,600
Break the dam!

2
00:00:11,320 --> 00:00:13,680
Release the river!

3
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:07,200
Sauron's wrath will be terrible,
his retribution swift.

4
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:17,000
The battle for Helm's Deep is over.

5
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:21,680
The battle for Middle-earth
is about to begin.

6
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:30,440
All our hopes now lie
with two little Hobbits

7
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:33,400
somewhere in the wilderness.

8
00:01:35,960 --> 00:01:37,880
Come on, Hobbitses!

9
00:01:38,120 --> 00:01:40,000
Long ways to go yet.

10
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,200
Sméagol will show you the way.

11
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,880
Follow me!
